## What this license covers

The MIT license above applies to the code in this repository: the front end,
the layer system, the spawn viewer, the coordinate transform, and the build
scripts.

It does NOT apply to the game data or imagery:

- The marker data in `public/data/` was sourced from
  [paldb.cc](https://paldb.cc) and belongs to them. It is included here so the
  map runs; it is not mine to relicense. If paldb would like it removed, open
  an issue and I will take it down.
- No Palworld game assets are distributed in this repository. Base map imagery
  is not included (see `public/map/README.md`) and `public/data/pal-art.json`
  holds filenames only, not artwork.
- Palworld is the property of Pocketpair, Inc. This is an unofficial,
  non-commercial fan project with no affiliation or endorsement.
